@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Graderate

[*] --> Waiting

state "Waiting" as Waiting
state "Active" as Active
state "Expired" as Expired
state "Archived" as Archived

Waiting --> Active: current date equals or surpasses start date
Active --> Expired: finish date is reached
Expired --> Archived: one year from expiration date passes

Expired --> [*]
Archived --> [*]

@enduml
